  "topic": {
    "id": "topic.cycle15.flytrap",
    "rationale": "Recommend the Venus flytrap fading-touch-memory premise. A plant without neurons nevertheless retains a recent signal whose timing changes its response. The viewer can understand where the information resides rather than receive an isolatedplant fact. Voyager is the closest rival with stronger remote engineering stakes, but needs more code/address scaffolding; Nyos has higher consequence but no inspected initiating trigger; change blindness offers self-relevance with narrower experimental generalization;experience machine earns reflection without settled resolution. Flytrap most directly couples the opening uncertainty to a visible temporal comparison and substantial mechanism. No biology/diversity/library bonus or renderer advantage; no prediction of performance."
  },
